<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/18/eng@/~cl_12> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 43 of the principal Act is amended in subparagraph (2)(b)(i) by substituting for the words “a State” the words “the Federal Territories or any State”. Amendment of section 46"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/18/eng@> .
