<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/18/eng@/~cl_14> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 57a the following section: “Practice directions 57b. The Chief Syariah Judge may, from time to time, issue such practice directions as may be necessary for the purpose of carrying into effect the provisions of this Act or any other written law relating to Syariah Court civil procedure, Syariah criminal procedure, Islamic family and Syariah evidence.”. Amendment of section 58"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/18/eng@> .
