<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/18/eng@/~cl_15__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) A person is qualified to be appointed under subsection (1) if he— (a) is a citizen; (b) is a Muslim; and (Amendment) (c) immediately before his appointment, is holding any office in the Syariah Officer’s Scheme in the general public service of the Federation for a continuous period of not less than ten years.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/18/eng@> .
