<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/18/eng@/~cl_15__para_e> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (3a) the following subsection: “(3b) The Deputy Chief Syariah Prosecutors shall have all powers of a Syariah Prosecutor and shall act as Chief Syariah Prosecutor during the absence or inability of the Chief Syariah Prosecutor.”. New section 59a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/18/eng@> .
